WEBVTT

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.217
A packing calculator can keep working after one input

00:00:10.217 --> 00:00:10.642
fails.

00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:13.472
An exception object describes a failure.

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:17.152
We will use one to choose a response and trace where

00:00:17.152 --> 00:00:18.567
execution continues.

00:00:40.283 --> 00:00:43.856
A try block groups operations whose failures may be

00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:44.417
handled.

00:00:44.417 --> 00:00:48.200
A catch block receives a matching exception object and

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.321
runs a response.

00:00:49.321 --> 00:00:52.544
ArithmeticException is the type for arithmetic

00:00:52.544 --> 00:00:55.486
failures such as integer division by zero.

00:00:55.486 --> 00:00:57.658
This loop calls share directly.

00:00:57.958 --> 00:01:00.342
The try and catch are inside the loop.

00:01:00.342 --> 00:01:03.604
There is also a message after them and another after

00:01:03.604 --> 00:01:04.169
the loop.

00:01:04.169 --> 00:01:07.494
Predict every output line for the three group counts,

00:01:07.494 --> 00:01:09.816
including which messages are skipped.

00:01:09.816 --> 00:01:11.133
Pause before running.

00:01:15.804 --> 00:01:18.739
Valid counts produce shares of four and three.

00:01:18.739 --> 00:01:21.992
The division failure leaves share without a result.

00:01:21.992 --> 00:01:25.310
This is abrupt completion: the operation ends before

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:27.096
its remaining work finishes.

00:01:27.096 --> 00:01:30.286
Java leaves unfinished method calls as it searches

00:01:30.286 --> 00:01:32.136
outward for a matching catch.

00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:33.667
This is stack unwinding.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:36.985
The Share print and Calculated are skipped for zero.

00:01:36.985 --> 00:01:40.366
After the catch block, Next input runs, then the loop

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.004
continues.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.516
Change the first group count to zero.

00:01:43.516 --> 00:01:45.360
Predict the complete output.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:48.455
Explain why the final group is still processed.
